        "Nile and the Tigris and the Euphrates where agriculture first developed allowing people " +
        "to settle in one place and build cities and create complex societies with laws and customs " +
        "and traditions that have been passed down through generations shaping the cultures and " +
        "identities of nations and peoples around the world today as we continue to build upon the " +
        "foundations laid by those who came before us striving to create a better future for all " +
        "of humanity through cooperation and innovation and the pursuit of knowledge and wisdom " +
        "that can help us solve the great challenges of our time including climate change and " +
        "poverty and disease and conflict which threaten the peace and prosperity that so many " +
